WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Hey Terminal is already connected to a temporary SSH host on a Mac.

00:03.000 --> 00:05.000
Codex CLI opens on the SSH host.

00:05.000 --> 00:09.000
The request is typed: “Summarize this demo workspace in one sentence.”

00:09.000 --> 00:19.000
Codex lists and reads the demo workspace files.

00:19.000 --> 00:23.000
Codex returns a one-sentence summary. No files are edited.

00:23.000 --> 00:26.000
The summary remains visible in Hey Terminal. This is a read-only demo.
